# Purple, the New Black: a party member (eve) joins main's registration at the entry door and enters; Galarhigg killed:
# won, 32001 to both; main's finish runs WotG 7's 32001 handler (status 1 to 2); eve's finish changes nothing (eve has
# the mission completed).
lists LaVauleS/_2d1/onTrigger LaVauleS/onEventFinish/2 LaVauleS/onEventUpdate/32000 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32000 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32001 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32002 LaVauleS/_2d3/onTrigger
char zone=LaVauleS pos=-260.44,0.134,-156.652 job=WAR lvl=99 nation=1
char eve zone=LaVauleS pos=-260.44,0.134,-156.652 job=WAR lvl=99 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg PurpleTheNewBlack current
